<title>NEW ZEALAND: RALLYING - RESULT OF THE NEW ZEALAND RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING - RESULT OF THE NEW ZEALAND RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the New Zealand rally</p>
<p>after the completion of the 24 special stages in three legs on</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p>1. Kenneth Erkisson (Sweden) Subaru overall time of four hours,</p>
<p>14 minutes and 11 seconds</p>
<p>2. Carlos Sainz (Spain) Ford 4:14.24</p>
<p>3. Juha Kankkunen (Finland) Ford 4:14.30</p>
<p>4. Richard Burns (Britain) Mitusbishi 4:15.29</p>
<p>5. Possoum Bourne (New Zealand) Subaru 4:20.05</p>
<p>6. Neal Bates (Australia) Toyota 4:25.53</p>
<p>7. Gustavo Trelles (Uruguay) Mitusbishi 4:27.55</p>
<p>8. Raul Sufan (Argentina) Toyota 4:29.23</p>
<p>9. Brian Stokes (New Zealand) Ford 4:29.38</p>
<p>10. Reece Jones (New Zealand) Mitsubishi 4:29.57</p>
<p>Leading world championship positions:</p>
<p>Drivers -</p>
<p>1. Tommi Makinen (Finland) 42,</p>
<p>2. Carlos Sainz (Spain) 34,</p>
<p>3. Colin McRae (Britain) 32,</p>
<p>4. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) 24,</p>
<p>5. Pierro Liatti (Italy) 18.</p>
<p>Manufacturers -</p>
<p>1. Subaru 74</p>
<p>2. Mitsubishi 56</p>
<p>3. Ford 55.</p>
